## Next Steps for the User:
1. Deploy the application to Vercel
2. Navigate to the project's Analytics section in the Vercel dashboard
3. Click "Enable" to activate Web Analytics
4. After deployment, verify the analytics are working by checking the browser Network tab for `/_vercel/insights/view` requests
5. View analytics data in the Vercel dashboard after user visits accumulate

